  "title": "pcapng-netflix-custom: Fix NFLX_BLOCK_TYPE_SKIP length.",
  "description": "Fix the computation of opt_cont_buf_len for NFLX_BLOCK_TYPE_SKIP.\nopt_cont_buf_len was always being set to (unsigned)-4 because\nwblock->rec->rec_header.custom_block_header.length had been set to 4 a few\nlines above.  This looks to be an oversight while refactoring in commit\n559282b46fa0a0256908a226d7426b70d8f3e4b5.\n\n\n(cherry picked from commit 965a7212633e6500c675233d1118eb45f2d93244)\n\nCo-authored-by: Darius Davis <darius-wireshark@free-range.com.au>",
